# Files where one careless change costs a server or a release.
#
# Applied migrations are checksummed by every server that ran them; an edit,
# even to a comment, stops those servers booting. Workflows hold the release
# and signing path. The license files state what everyone may do with the
# code.
#
# GitHub asks these owners for review on any pull request that touches them.
# That is a request until a ruleset also requires code-owner review.

/virtues-core/migrations/            @aajaces
/services/virtues-atlas/migrations/  @aajaces
/services/virtues-api/migrations/    @aajaces
/.github/workflows/                  @aajaces
/.github/CODEOWNERS                  @aajaces
/LICENSE                             @aajaces
/apps/mac-source/LICENSE             @aajaces
/apps/web/plugins/LICENSE            @aajaces
/crates/virtues-registry/LICENSE     @aajaces
